  "description": "Role / API-key / JWT auth-hardening for the LevelUp.Health backend packages: keyed-HMAC hashed API-key validation with live rotation, the fail-closed role-requirement endpoint filter (JWT-claim-over-trusted-header precedence), JWT-bearer hardening (2-minute clock skew, audience/issuer/lifetime validation), a reusable resource-ownership (\"self-read\") filter with a pluggable ownership port, and the OpenAPI security-scheme transformer. Ares-specific strings are options with the Ares values preserved as defaults.",
